@startuml
title Vina Bim Shop Lambda Architecture — Runnable Services

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 180

actor "Executive Teams\n1-hour freshness" as Executive
actor "BI/Livestreaming Teams\nreal-time visibility" as BI

rectangle "Source Systems" as Sources {
  component "Periodic table-state exports\ncustomers, sellers, products,\norders, payments, shipments" as Offline
  component "JSON event producer\nbusiness event envelopes" as Producer
}

queue "Kafka\ncommerce_events\ncatalog_events\nfulfillment_events\nops_events" as Kafka

rectangle "Lambda Processing Paths" as Lambda {
  component "Spark Batch Path\nhourly validation, dedup,\nschema evolution handling,\nbatch aggregates" as Spark
  component "Flink Streaming Path\nevent-time watermarks,\nallowed lateness,\nreal-time revenue/issues/anomalies" as Flink
}

database "MinIO Medallion Lakehouse\nBronze batch: Parquet snapshots\nBronze event: JSONL replay logs\nSilver/Gold: curated Iceberg tables" as MinIO
database "Hive Metastore\ncatalog only" as Hive
component "Trino SQL Serving\ncanonical SQL over curated tables" as Trino
component "Apache Pinot\nRealtime serving sink\nfresh and provisional" as Realtime
database "DuckDB executive mart\nlocal compatibility path" as DuckDB

rectangle "Control Plane" as Control {
  component "Airflow\nbatch orchestration\nand scheduling" as Airflow
  component "Great Expectations\nquality gates\nand validation" as GX
}

rectangle "Governance" as Gov {
  component "DataHub\nmetadata, lineage,\nglossary, tags" as DataHub
}

component "Evidence Package\nhealth, screenshots,\nrow counts, reconciliation" as Evidence

Offline --> MinIO : Parquet snapshots: checkpointed table state
Producer --> Kafka : JSON envelope events
Kafka --> Flink : direct real-time consumption
Kafka --> MinIO : JSONL event log: replayable business events
MinIO --> Spark : hourly batch reads landed Bronze data
Spark --> MinIO : curated Silver/Gold Iceberg tables
Flink --> Realtime : event-time live metrics / alerts / dashboard
Realtime --> BI : live operations
Flink --> MinIO : curated streaming tables
MinIO --> Hive : table registration for curated lakehouse tables
Hive --> Trino : catalog metadata
Trino --> Executive : canonical hourly SQL dashboards
MinIO --> DuckDB : hourly export from Gold tables
DuckDB --> Executive : local KPI mart
Trino --> BI : reconciled historical SQL
Airflow --> Spark : orchestrates batch jobs
Airflow --> GX : triggers quality gates
GX --> DataHub : publishes quality metadata
Trino --> DataHub : registers table lineage
Airflow --> DataHub : ingestion jobs
Trino --> Evidence : KPI query outputs
Realtime --> Evidence : dashboard query outputs
DataHub --> Evidence : lineage evidence

note bottom of MinIO
Staged compose profiles provide the runnable implementation.
dbt-DuckDB remains a local compatibility and parity-testing path.
See architecture/decisions/ for the full ADR roadmap.
end note

@enduml
